      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank you for adding this component to SDK3 worlds!\nAlthough VRChat may currently have no plans to add it to avatars, it is still a feature deserving of a canny. I have created a new canny specifically for avatars. Feel free to voice your support here:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/whitelist-particlesystemforcefield-on-avatars-for-more-interactivity",
